 <h3><u>Khuld me sabr</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Khuld me sabr o ita'at ki rawani fizza..(2)<br> hai zaeefi me aqeede ki jawani fizza</p> 
  <p>Aal e imraan ki pakeeza nishani fizza<br> khud hi hai lafz e wafa khud hi ma'ani fizza<br> jism kaate nahi hote wo chaman hai fizza<br> hadd hai zehra ne kaha meri behen hai fizza</p> 
  <p>Tum ne hasnain ki maa banke hifazat ki hai<br> tumne qur'aan ke lehje me khitabat ki hai<br> tumne haider ki tarah deen ki wiqalat ki hai<br> tumne zehra ke musalle pe ibadat ki hai</p> 
  <p>Aae jibreel jo qur'aan ki aayat lekar<br> bayte zehra me gaye tumse ijazat lekar</p> 
  <p>Turbat e saniye zehra ki mujabir tum ho<br> yani mastoor me hum soorat e jabir tum ho<br> ghar me zehra ke ho yu risht se qasir tum ho<br> saath masoom o ke anwaar ki zaer tum ho</p> 
  <p>Ye sharaf log kaneezo ko kaha dete hai<br> fatima zehra ke bacche tumhe maa kehte hai</p> 
  <p>Chawda(14) sadiyo se bahattar ki azadar ho tum<br> binte zehra ke liye sayae deewar ho tum<br> naaz karti hai wafa jispe wo qirdaar ho tum<br> khana e zehra ki namak khaar ho tum</p> 
  <p>Har mawaddat ke sahife me tera qissa hai<br> fatima zehra ke faqo me tera hissa hai</p> 
  <p>Aake saael ne kabhi darr pe jo dastak dedi<br> arsh walo ne kabhi aake jo roti mangi</p> 
  <p>Aagai leke wo darwaze pe khairat e ali<br> hukm e haider pe farishto ki bhi bhardi jholi</p> 
  <p>Ye bhi ek teri azmat ka hawala fizza<br> rizq maula ne tere haath se baata fizza</p> 
  <p>Kya likhe meer takallum tere ausaaf bhala<br> aaj islaam ki pehchan hai qirdaar tera<br> naam lete hai adab se tera sab ehle aza<br> tujhko zehra ki kaneezi ka sila aisa mila</p> 
  <p>Jo bhi ab shaam ziyarat ke liye jaata hai<br> sajda karne teri chaukhat pe zaroor aata hai</p> 
  <p>Khuld me sabr o ita'at ki rawani fizza..</p> 
